0..54 Comment "//! `held-within` keeps a shared view inside its hold."
55..58 Comment "//!"
59..132 Comment "//! The hold freezes its value. The pathological twin refuses a view that"
133..171 Comment "//! escapes the hold as `ViewEscaped`."
172..175 Comment "//!"
176..250 Comment "//! The checker keeps each view at its declared hold. Both examples run to"
251..310 Comment "//! `42`. The source imports the early exit host interface."
311..314 Comment "//!"
